@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #243247
skinparam ArrowColor #53657A
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #E2EDFC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BDAA65
title Creating a split expense (validated inputs)
participant "app: TripJio" as App #E8EDF3
participant "command: SplitCommand" as Cmd #E2EDFC
participant "expenses: ExpenseList" as Expenses #E3F3EF
participant "ui: Ui" as Ui #EFE6F8
activate App
App -> Cmd ++ : execute(state, ui)
create participant "expense: SplitExpense" as Split #E3F3EF
Cmd -> Split : new SplitExpense(..., 90, 3, null, ...)
activate Split
note right of Split
  Rounded equal share = $30.
  Inherited Expense amount stores the $90 bill.
  Overridden getAmount() returns the $30 share.
end note
Split --> Cmd : constructed expense
deactivate Split
Cmd -> Expenses ++ : add(expense)
Expenses --> Cmd --
Cmd -> Expenses ++ : size()
Expenses --> Cmd -- : count
Cmd -> Ui ++ : showMessage(...)
Ui --> Cmd --
Cmd --> App --
note over App, Ui
  AppState getters are omitted.
  The main loop next checks the affected month's budget
  and saves because isMutating() returns true.
end note
deactivate App
@enduml
